<script async src="https://www.instagram.com/embed.js"></script><p>The 2026/2027 Ligue 1 McDonald’s season will kick off on Friday, August 21, 2026, and conclude on Saturday, May 29, 2027, with the simultaneous matches (Multiplex) of the 34th and final matchday.</p><p>On opening day, Olympique de Marseille will host RC Strasbourg Alsace, while defending champions Paris Saint-Germain will welcome Stade Rennais to the Parc des Princes.</p><p>Matchday 2 already promises excitement, with AS Monaco hosting Olympique de Marseille and LOSC facing Paris Saint-Germain at home.</p><p>Here is the full schedule for Matchday 1 of the 2026/2027 Ligue 1 McDonald’s season, broadcast live on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://plus.ligue1.com/home">Ligue 1+</a>:</p><p>Angers SCO – LOSC<br>Havre AC – AS Monaco<br>Le Mans FC – Stade Brestois 29<br>RC Lens – AJ Auxerre<br>Olympique de Marseille – RC Strasbourg Alsace<br>OGC Nice – FC Lorient<br>Paris Saint-Germain – Stade Rennais FC<br>Toulouse FC – Olympique Lyonnais<br>ESTAC Troyes – Paris FC</p><p>Matchday 14 of Ligue 1 McDonald’s, scheduled for the weekend of December 12, 2026, will mark the start of the winter break, with the season resuming on the weekend of January 2, 2027.</p><p>At the end of the season, the final two matchdays of Ligue 1 McDonald’s will be played in a simultaneous match format (Multiplex) on Saturdays, May 22 and May 29, 2027.</p><p><i>Check out the 10 "Top Ten" matches already selected from Ligue 1 McDonald’s—broadcast live on </i><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://plus.ligue1.com/home"><i>Ligue 1+</i></a><i>—for the 2026/2027 season*:</i></p><p>Matchday 2: LOSC vs. Paris Saint-Germain, Sunday, August 30 at 8:45 PM<br>Matchday 5: Olympique de Marseille vs. Paris Saint-Germain, Sunday, September 20 at 8:45 PM<br>Matchday 8: Paris Saint-Germain vs. Olympique Lyonnais, Sunday, October 25 at 8:45 PM<br>Matchday 10: RC Lens vs. Olympique de Marseille, Sunday, November